															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-screamur" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2856989); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2856989&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606337834" alt="Mr_Screamur" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2856989)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-screamur" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2856989); return false;" >Mr_Screamur</a></span> <span class="odate time_1606314482 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">25 Nov 2020 14:28</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4827841">
									

<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Genre: Horror</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Idea&nbsp;Pitch</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Idea&nbsp;Pitch</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><br />
Elevator Pitch: The basic idea for this SCP is a creature who commits acts of horrific violence against people who are considered to be one of the most repulsive kind of people alive (sexual predators). Despite the cruel and sometimes downright evil nature of the creature the audience can't help but root for it sometimes as the details of it's murders are revealed through reports and interviews.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: The LAPD are investigating a string of murders, the victims are all men and women either accused or found guilty of sexual abuse. The only other thing connecting the victims is that they were all last spotted with a different person who the police can find no records proving they exist. As there are so far 15 victims and 15 people with no proof of existence it has the police both confused and at a loss for what to do.</p>
<p>A Foundation mole inside the LAPD brings the case to the attention of the Foundation who find the circumstances suspicious and decide to investigate themselves. Eventually after tracking potential victims in the area they catch the creature in the act, taking the form of an attractive secretary it has lured the Reigional Manager of a local tobacco company (who has been using his power to sexually harrass, grope and pressure young female employees and interns into sex) into bed. Only to use non human apendages to slit the man's throat and begin mutilating his corpse.</p>
<p>The Foundation capture and contain the creature, bringing it back for further study. Where it's psychology, biology, nature, abilites of mental manipulation and shapeshifting are researched by the foundation.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: A vicious and psychotic creature that rather than doing the standard killing of innocent people to satisfy a bloodlust, is targetting and punishing those that arguably deserve what they are getting.</p>
<p>Additional Notes: The subject of sexual assualt and abuse is a very sensetive issue, this SCP idea is not intended to make light of these issues. Rather show them for what they are; evil and dispicable. As well helping readers to vent thir frustrations about these issues by seeing predators get served unmerciful justice. It's not my intention to make survivors relive their trauma so if this idea makes it to draft a trigger warning will be provided.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

